{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_51","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'git log -1 --pretty=fuller'","aggregated_output":"commit d7e555b65f5c7fb4cb7f7b205c686f2800930489\nAuthor:     GitHub Copilot <copilot@github.com>\nAuthorDate: Sat May 9 22:02:32 2026 +0000\nCommit:     GitHub Copilot <copilot@github.com>\nCommitDate: Sat May 9 22:02:32 2026 +0000\n\n    Update CD45RO memory T cell marker definitions\n    \n    Remove CD44-high and CD122-high constraints from CL_0001203 and CL_0001204 so human CD45RO-positive memory T cell parents no longer impose those high marker phenotypes.\n    \n    Add the requested PMID definition xrefs and issue tracker annotations for issue 3454.\n    \n    Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot <copilot@github.com>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
